{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:5ed41faeba58ac3f1a05bdcfc0b820926f9d287eb49f0112e808010ab812522d",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04bd3df3fde2ad19a67c196f6153710eb97faafb6758d65230ad31f5f0bcdd36",
      "text": "……喂喂？啊，是我。\n突然打电话过来真抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c2b5883437710e700323273e2c71a8fabe3ab3d84b17f1775e1514a31f996b5",
      "text": "庙会的余韵还在心头萦绕，\n想和阁下稍微说两句。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bc9cf9d3861bf0eb0804dc56676c28c650a0b99b1acfcf4935949f465fd019e",
      "text": "在烟花绽放的夜空下举行演出，\n让我得到了一次宝贵的经历。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73b970d185ec54b04b2fdf147b8e00e96245567d60baf9874add7fc6039cdcf5",
      "text": "我拿出了如今所具备的所有力量，\n不知在阁下看来如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000014:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:238fc7fc5f347cb797a5ef3c3e87645988922ea1442714508f14ee3b608a3461",
      "text": "是一场很棒的演出！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000017:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c68d0256da6df3ca3f16a4930146adade15855fc40429deaa7b03c3faf0b5b8",
      "text": "那样我就放心了。\n……啊，宝贵的经历可不只有演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000019:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbe4f55857ff449eae33d771f5bcc80709e437c11b36883a4f1fd8f5f720c12e",
      "text": "虽然只有片刻时光，\n但我能和大家一起逛了庙会。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000021:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c0706979bd74fa68083901596682a87f7b089242328fc3b6235eee49ebb0cee1",
      "text": "毕竟在成为偶像之前，我几乎没有\n和同龄人接触的机会啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000023:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5d547b702bb05c301ef05d05025ef4ec15de785491cfebc23fe04c19a671dff",
      "text": "这次能获得和大家交流的机会，真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:008rei_401_2_4_008_01_09_a:2_4_008_01_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b86005b667b6737d5fa3d0ea517db46683bddf1ccd5cc69e988042a296569e34",
      "text": "……虽然说是片刻，却不知不觉聊了很久呢。\n多谢你的陪伴。那么，再见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
